sequenceDiagram
    actor L as Learner
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Supabase (PostgreSQL)
    L->>App: Open a Lesson in the current Topic (first time or replay, BR-36)
    App->>API: GET /lessons/{lesson_id}
    API->>DB: Fetch new vocab + review vocab (previous lesson)
    DB-->>API: Lesson vocabulary + question templates
    API-->>App: Lesson session (interleaved queue, stored for offline use)
    loop each item in queue
        App->>L: Present item (flashcard / MCQ / listen-select / drag-drop / fill-blank)
        L->>App: Submit answer
        alt Correct
            App->>App: Mark item done
        else Incorrect (attempt 1-2)
            App->>L: Show correct answer
            App->>App: Re-queue item to back of queue (BR-21)
        else Incorrect (3rd consecutive attempt)
            App->>L: Show correct answer, mark passed
            App->>App: Record error_count +1 locally (BR-21)
        end
    end
    App->>API: POST /lessons/{lesson_id}/complete {answers[]}
    API->>API: Recompute correctness, error_count and Star rating (BR-16, BR-23)
    API->>DB: Save LESSON_PROGRESS, add only the improvement over the best rating to star_total (BR-36)
    opt Topic Final Test is locked
        API->>DB: stars_earned_since_lock += full session rating (BR-20)
    end
    API-->>App: Lesson complete
    opt All lessons in Topic complete and Final Test available
        L->>App: Start Final Test
        App->>API: POST /topics/{topic_id}/final-test/start
        API->>API: Generate 20 random questions by rules (all formats)
        API-->>App: attempt_id + Final Test session
        L->>App: Submit answers
        App->>API: POST /topics/{topic_id}/final-test/{attempt_id}/submit
        API->>DB: Insert FINAL_TEST_ATTEMPT (unlock_cycle, attempt_number)
        alt Score >= 80%
            API->>DB: Unlock next Topic, migrate Topic vocab into REVIEW_CARD (SM-2 pool)
            API->>DB: For vocab with error_count >= 2: force EF < 2.5, label weak (BR-6, BR-20)
            API-->>App: Passed — next Topic unlocked
        else Score < 80% and attempt_number < 3
            API-->>App: Failed — retry immediately with new random set
        else Score < 80% on the last attempt of the cycle
            API->>DB: Lock Final Test and next Topic, stars_earned_since_lock = 0 (BR-20)
            API-->>App: Locked — earn 30 Stars to unlock one new attempt
            App-->>L: Show "x/30 Stars" progress, Lessons of this Topic stay open for replay
        end
    end
